'''Arcane Scarabs''' are a monster that is summoned by [[Kephri]] in the [[Tombs of Amascut]]. They slowly charge up red swarms around themselves. If allowed to fully charge, they will unleash the red swarm and deal massive damage, although it can be reduced by using [[Protect from Magic]]. After enough combat, the scarab will relocate, dispersing the red swarm around them.

It is possible for the scarab to relocate if it takes 39 damage or more in a single hit.{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://x.com/jagexash/status/1850841701327282588|date=28 October 2024|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/27963443|archivedate=7 April 2026|quote=I confirm it has such a mechanic.}} Otherwise, the scarab will relocate after 2 + N hits, where N is the amount of players in the raid. Missed attacks will contribute towards relocating the scarab whereas thrall attacks and burn damage do not.

